<title>EL SALVADOR: SOCCER-EL SALVADOR AND UNITED STATES DRAW WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-EL SALVADOR AND UNITED STATES DRAW WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>SAN SALVADOR 1997-06-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>El Salvador and the United</p>
<p>States drew 1-1 (halftime 1-1) in a World Cup CONCACAF zone</p>
<p>qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>United States - Roy Lasiter 51</p>
<p>El Salvador - Raul Diaz Arce 60</p>
<p>Attendance: 35,000</p>
<p>    Standings	   P  W  D  L F   A Pts</p>
<p> 1. Mexico		5  3  2  0 13  2 11</p>
<p> 2. Costa Rica	  5  2  1  2  7  6  7</p>
<p> 3. United States     5  1  3  1  8  6  6</p>
<p> 4. El Salvador	 5  1  2  2  3  4  5</p>
<p> 5. Canada		5  1  2  2  1  7  5</p>
<p> 6. Jamaica	     5  1  2  2  2  9  5</p>
<p>Next match: August 10, Costa Rica v El Salvador.</p>
<p>Top three team qualify for the World Cup finals in France</p>
<p>next year.</p>
</text>
